{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find object, approach it, take it, check its properties and perform specific task, move if needed. Scan area if object not visible. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
